{"unit_id":"domitor-syh__dsh-rollback#feature-1","repo":"domitor-syh/dsh-rollback","commit":"11a323de69b7fdb2733258f7adb74516066367ea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-rollback** 的功能「按轮次回退」：撤回选定轮次以来的已跟踪文件状态，并截断对应的会话对话。用户可通过 `/rollback` 选择轮次或输入轮次参数执行。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:155-178","src/service.ts:1206-1287"]}
{"unit_id":"domitor-syh__dsh-rollback#feature-2","repo":"domitor-syh/dsh-rollback","commit":"11a323de69b7fdb2733258f7adb74516066367ea","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-rollback** 的功能「回退预览」：展示目标轮次的受影响文件、恢复或删除动作、冲突信息及对话截断情况。通过回退弹窗或 `/rollback preview <轮次>` 查看计划。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:45-62","src/index.ts:155-162"]}
